{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 48, :comments ["<b>And when a sojourner sojourns with you.</b> The sense of \"with you\": in the land of Egypt." "And the sense of \"and he shall make the Passover\" — he wishes to make the Passover, let him be circumcised first." "And the sense of \"and no uncircumcised person shall eat of it\" — concerning Israelites who were not circumcised, like those born in the wilderness on the way."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:33:58.414713961Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}